    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish \u2018n Ships is a cozy 2D fishing game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish!</strong><br>There are plenty of fish in the sea, and you can catch them all. Charging casts and manipulating your hook and line allows you to try and catch any fish you see in the water. But watch out, not all fish want to be caught!<br><br>Sell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring back your haul to the port and sell your fish at the market. Some fish are worth more than others, so make sure you\u2019re catching what\u2019s in demand! Or you can feed your fish to the gulls. Who knows, you might just be rewarded! <br> <br><strong>Upgrade!</strong> <br>Spend money to upgrade your hook, boat, and more. Upgrades let you cast further, fish deeper, and catch bigger. You can also travel to different fishing spots and find even more fish!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish \u2018n Ships is a cozy 2D fishing game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish!</strong><br>There are plenty of fish in the sea, and you can catch them all. Charging casts and manipulating your hook and line allows you to try and catch any fish you see in the water. But watch out, not all fish want to be caught!<br><br>Sell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring back your haul to the port and sell your fish at the market. Some fish are worth more than others, so make sure you\u2019re catching what\u2019s in demand! Or you can feed your fish to the gulls. Who knows, you might just be rewarded! <br> <br><strong>Upgrade!</strong> <br>Spend money to upgrade your hook, boat, and more. Upgrades let you cast further, fish deeper, and catch bigger. You can also travel to different fishing spots and find even more fish!</p>",
    "short_description": "Take to the seas on your little boat and catch some fish in this 2D cozy fishing experience! Explore the drizzly coastline, upgrade your boat, and bring home the big one! How many fish can you catch?",
